            "opvoer": {
              "sectie": {
                "kennisartikeltaalvariant_id": 11,
                "rel_id": 0,
                "type": "inhoud",
                "inhoud": "With a bitemporal register, it is always possible to determine exactly: what was the situation at time T in reality, and what was recorded at time R? This enables precise audits and retroactive corrections without deleting historical data.",
